{"title":"Vladdin Salts","description":"\u003cp\u003eVladdin is being loved in the international market with high quality product lines and focuses on the best experiences for vaper followers. Vladdin, a brand familiar with vapers who love the Pod System line playing salt nic.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"vladdin-nic-salt-tobacco","title":"Vladdin Nic Salt - Tobacco","description":"\u003cp\u003eVladdin Tobacco Saltnic 30ml, a brand familiar to vapers who love the salt nic Pod System. Tobacco by \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vladdin-salts\" title=\"Vladdin salts\"\u003eVladdin\u003c\/a\u003e gives you the best mouthwatering flavor of tobacco with a cinnamon touch.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 30mg \u0026amp; 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePG\/VG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 30ml Chubby Gorilla Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vladdin","offers":[{"title":"30mg","offer_id":41774705442871,"sku":"Vladdin Tobacco 30 MG","price":1490.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41774705475639,"sku":"Vladdin Tobacco 50 MG","price":1490.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Vladdin-Tobacco-Saltnic-30ml.jpg?v=1752483981"},{"product_id":"vladdin-nic-salt-lush-ice","title":"Vladdin Nic Salt - Lush Ice","description":"\u003cp\u003eVladdin Lush Ice Saltnic 30ml, a brand familiar to vapers who love the salt nic Pod System. Lush Ice by Vladdin gives you the best mouthwatering flavor of watermelon with smoothing ice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 30mg \u0026amp; 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePG\/VG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 30ml Chubby Gorilla Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":